ht... that we would be heroes, sacrificing ourselves for the sake of others.","nextNodeIds":[710622609]},{"nodeId":710622609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"Anton","textMapHash":4282097906,"text":"*sigh*... Who'd have thought things would turn out like this?","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710622610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3452674882,"text":"About the \"Dark Calamity\"...","nextNodeIds":[710622611]},{"nodeId":710622611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"Anton","textMapHash":2192657938,"text":"\"Dark Calamity,\" \"the Calamity of Darkness,\" or whatever you call it... They all mean the great disaster that occurred five hundred years ago.","nextNodeIds":[710622612]},{"nodeId":710622612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"Anton","textMapHash":3685684122,"text":"Anyway, it's the eternal enemy of Snezhnaya... For five hundred years, the calamity has been lurking in the dark and we'll be on guard forever.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710622613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1705195450,"text":"About you...","nextNodeIds":[710622614]},{"nodeId":710622614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"Anton","textMapHash":2527180706,"text":"About us? There's nothing much to talk about... We fought hard and we failed. That's all.","nextNodeIds":[710622615]},{"nodeId":710622615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"Anton","textMapHash":3792543506,"text":"When we first came down, we were the Ninth Company, a company of 64 soldiers. But now, I guess half of our men including our commander have either gone missing or died... Well, maybe not yet half of us...","nextNodeIds":[710622616]},{"nodeId":710622616,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"Anton","textMapHash":1133566282,"text":"But anyway, it's around that figure. We lost this battle and should've retreated long ago.","nextNodeIds":[710622617]},{"nodeId":710622617,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3384919146,"text":"But your people on the ground attacked Liyue Harbor.","nextNodeIds":[710622618]},{"nodeId":710622618,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"Anton","textMapHash":2940942274,"text":"...It's surprising but I think I can understand why.","nextNodeIds":[710622619]},{"nodeId":710622619,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"Anton","textMapHash":2986685930,"text":"To assist in endeavors of greater meaning, Lord Pulcinella won't hesitate to dispense with less valuable assets. That's his logic.","nextNodeIds":[710622620]},{"nodeId":710622620,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"Anton","textMapHash":3192923418,"text":"As his direct subordinate, I have no objections to his cause of action...","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7106233,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7106207","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"